<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="fissure-stone-fragments">Fissure Stone Fragments for Holy Paladin Healer in P3</h3>With Phase 3, Cataclysm Classic has a new dungeon difficulty added: Elemental Rune Dungeons. Completing these instances on Protocol Inferno mode will reward you with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, which can be traded in for several normal and heroic items from Phase 1 raids, (ilvl 359-379). Three of the items available for purchase, (<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65124/fall-of-mortality">
<img alt="Fall of Mortality" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fall of Mortality</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60232/shroud-of-endless-grief">
<img alt="Shroud of Endless Grief" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Endless Grief</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65375/tempest-keeper-belt">
<img alt="Tempest Keeper Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tempest Keeper Belt</span></a>
<span class="q4"> of the Undertow</span>), are best in slot for all of Phase 3, even over Heroic Firelands gear, and therefore these dungeons are of high priority if you do not posses these pieces. Note that the satchels have a chance to drop several different stat combinations, and therefore may require several purchases. You should always focus on upgrading your weakest gear slot but some items to prioritize are listed below. <br/>
<br/>
