<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-justice-points">Valor &amp; Justice Points for Holy Paladin Healer in P3</h3>In Cataclysm Phase 3, new items have been added to the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> vendors, and Phase 1 items previous purchasable with Valor are now purchasable for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. When spending  <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, your general priority should be to pick up tier pieces, (as these are required to obtain the Heroic counterparts), and then after to replace the lowest ilvl items in your current gear set. <br/>
<br/>Valor and Justice items of particular note are listed below, in a loose priority:<br/>
<br/>
