<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-holy-paladin-healer">Chest for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>In Cataclysm, you must purchase the normal mode version of the tier chest/<wbr/>gloves/<wbr/>legs/<wbr/>relic to access the heroic version, so this is one of those slots. While multiple epic items are available, the gap in power between them is relatively large. Players willing to accept some risk may prioritize purchasing this piece of tier as the legs and hands pieces have a chance to drop from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74191/enchant-chest-mighty-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Mighty Stats</span></a> (budget)<div class="pad"></div>
