<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-holy-paladin-healer">Wrist for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Protocol Inferno allows for an excellent pre-raid option for the wrist slot otherwise obtainable only from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=45213/sinestra">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sinestra</span></a>. The availability of this item somewhat invalidates what would otherwise be a decent valor item added in Phase 3.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
