<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-holy-paladin-healer">Hands for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>In Cataclysm, you must purchase the normal mode version of the tier chest/<wbr/>gloves/<wbr/>legs/<wbr/>relic to access the heroic version, so this is one of those slots. Some players may wish to use non-tier in this slot in their final bis set, which would make this less of a priority for spending valor on, though it is recommended you pick it up regardless. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74198/enchant-gloves-haste">
