<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-holy-paladin-healer">Waist for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Waist is the second slot were holy paladins can actually acquire their phase best in slot item without stepping into a raid. Any affix here is good, though of the Undertow will always be best. All of the ilvl 359 choices are very close, so it's generally recommended to pick up the rep one instead especially as it's itemized perfectly and easy to obtain.<div class="pad"></div>
