<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-holy-paladin-healer">Legs for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Plenty of amazing options available pre-raid here. In Cataclysm, you must purchase the normal mode version of the tier chest/<wbr/>gloves/<wbr/>legs/<wbr/>relic to access the heroic version, so this is one of those slots. Tier legs this phase are also perfectly itemized for holy paladin, so picking them up should likely be you highest priority.  <br/>
<br/>It is worth noting that while there is a leg armor option from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a>, it is actually worse than the 346 option listed below due to itemization.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54450/powerful-ghostly-spellthread">
