<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-holy-paladin-healer">Feet for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>There are few options for feet armor pieces in Phase 3. Potentially important is that the second best item here is actually BoE, so it is theoretically purchasable from other players or the auction house, or can be sent over from another character on your account. Once again all the 346 ilvl options are relatively interchangeable. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
