<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">
<span class="c2">Jewelry for Holy Paladin Healer</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-holy-paladin-healer">Neck for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Lots of options for this slot, though again the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> is far and away the best choice. While the BoE choice may seem like an attempting option, it is generally not recommended.<div class="pad"></div>
