<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-holy-paladin-healer">Rings for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>For rings we have one obviously BiS option, and then several middling choices. Each ring here is largely interchangeable with other rings of the same item level with the exepction of the ring from the Molten Front, (<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70124/spirit-fragment-band">
<img alt="Spirit Fragment Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spirit Fragment Band</span></a>), which underperforms for its ilvl.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Intellect</span></a> (<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/professions/enchanting/overview">Enchanting</a>)<div class="pad"></div>
