<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-holy-paladin-healer">Trinkets for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65124/fall-of-mortality">
<img alt="Fall of Mortality" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fall of Mortality</span></a> is a stellar trinket now available from dungeons in Phase 3, and seems likely to remain equipped for the rest of the tier. Due to Spirit and Haste being so strong for Holy Paladins, the options for holy paladin's second trinket slot in pre-bis are all quite similar, though the Darkmoon Card is highly recommended. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60233/shard-of-woe">
<img alt="Shard of Woe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_iceshard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shard of Woe</span></a> may seem tempting but is heavily nerfed on the Cataclysm Classic patch.<div class="pad"></div>
