<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Holy Paladin Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-holy-paladin-healer">Main Hand Weapons for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>The <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> added a new Pre-Bis weapon option for Holy Paladins in Phase 3. While likely expensive, this item is highly recommended as it is only replaced by items from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a>, and is better than other raid options before then. As always options at the same item level as each other are relatively interchangeable.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
