<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-and-shields-for-holy-paladin-healer">Off-Hands and Shields for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>The biggest change to off-hands in Cataclysm is that now, there is a dedicated off-hand enchant that works on ALL off-hands, not just shields. This combined with the fact that off-hands and shields have the same stat values means that while we still do generally prefer shields due to the free armor and lower contest, we can now freely use non-shield off-hands as well if that's what we have.<br/>
<br/>This Pre-BiS Choice here remains the same as Phase 1.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Off-Hand or Shield Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74235/enchant-off-hand-superior-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Off-Hand - Superior Intellect</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="grid max-width">
